Hanumān stands on Trikūṭa and beholds Laṅkā --- Hanumān boasts many hundred yōjanas mean nothing --- Hanumān surveys moats gold walls banners and guards --- Hanumān judges Laṅkā impregnable even to gods --- Only Aṅgada Nīla Sugrīva and Hanumān can reach --- Hanumān resolves to learn if Sītā lives first --- Hanumān shrinks cat-small and enters at dusk --- Moon rises like a swan as Hanumān gazes
